message: "If you use this independent audit package, please cite it as below."
title: "Independent Reconstruction of Geometric Unity — Source, Covariance and Shiab Audit"
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: 2026-08-31
authors:
  - family-names: Muffatti
    given-names: Angus
type: report
abstract: "A source-faithful reconstruction and TP-00 acceptance-gate audit of the official Geometric Unity corpus. The package identifies incompatible printed gauge-sign conventions, rejects the literal first-order covariance claim, types the explicit substitute Shiab, and verifies its Clifford-Einstein action on the geometric Riemann sector while proving that the official sources do not determine a unique full adjoint Hessian or spectrum."
